## 📝 File Naming Conventions

### Component Files
```
✅ PascalCase for components:
  - LoginForm.tsx
  - ExperienceDialog.tsx
  - ResumeCard.tsx
  - ActionButtons.tsx

✅ kebab-case for utility/config files:
  - api-client.service.ts
  - resume-helpers.ts
  - personal-info.validations.ts

✅ index.tsx for barrel exports:
  - components/shared/dialogs/index.tsx
